Band Description: The Rime Ghosts are four descendants of the Vanguard-7 crew: Lyra (lead vocals, improvised data-scavenging loops), Kael (repurposed ship-interface synths, bass drones), Jax (modified LinnDrum sequencer, structural percussion samples), and Elara (atmospheric pads, spectral effects, spoken word transmissions). Their aesthetic is functional-cybernetic: patched ship uniforms augmented with glowing wire tendrils and optical displays, faces often obscured by repurposed comms gear. They create Stasis Pop by turning the ship's life-support rhythms into propulsive beats, weaving Lyra's haunting, often auto-tuned laments of lost Earth over Kael's shuddering, hull-resonance basslines, while Jax layers frantic, glitchy percussion from system errors, and Elara bathes everything in the "Deep Sleep" pads – the very sonic signature of the void they travel.
