Track 2: Are We The Anomaly?
- Story & Context: Deep within the ship's 'Memory Archives,' a young cartographer named Jax, while repairing a corrupted generational data chip showing faded holographic images of Earth forests, confessed to Elara that he sometimes felt an innate disquiet, a constant, low thrum beneath his skin, wondering if their very existence as generations-long travelers was an error in the cosmic design. "My genesis is just a coordinate in the dark."
